My own opinion about improving the spell system is that two things should be
done. One, the spell should be more powerful, permanent(unlimited use), and av-
ailable for magic users. But, to counter that, have metal armor absorb most of the magical energy and make effective/deadly spells difficult or impossible to cast.

These two features could combine to make people who play the magic users develop a different strategy than those who just hack and slash. 

Another addition is to limit priests to non-edged weapons, wizards to staves and daggers...


